s="svg-inline--fa fa-circle-info h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="circle-info" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"><path class="" fill="currentColor" d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM216 336l24 0 0-64-24 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24l48 0c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24l0 88 8 0c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24l-80 0c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24zm40-208a32 32 0 1 1 0 64 32 32 0 1 1 0-64z"></path></svg></a></div><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="flex w-full pt-2 sm:h-[70%] sm:overflow-hidden"><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-1 lg:h-auto lg:flex-col"><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="h-fit w-full gap-2" style="display: none;"><textarea data-v-c9f9a3ec="" placeholder="Input arguments" class="p-small bloc background-primary stroke-secondary-default h-10 w-full resize-none rounded border p-2 outline-none print:border min-h-auto" value=""></textarea></div><!----><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="jd26-ide-io-note print:hidden"> Interactive is on, so your program asks for input while it runs. Type your answers in Output. </div><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="hidden min-h-fit rounded-lg px-1 print:block print:border"><label data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="p-normal my-2 block px-3">Interactive Mode: On</label></div></div></div><!----></div></div><div class="flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-8 pb-2 sm:gap-5 lg:p-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs-output-item" id="scrollOutputComp"><div data-v-63d94bc4="" class="pb-3 lg:pb-0 flex h-full flex-col"><div data-v-63d94bc4="" class="jd26-ide-io-head jd26-io-subtabs"><button data-v-63d94bc4="" class="jd26-ide-io-tab jd26-ide-io-tab-active"><div data-v-63d94bc4="">Output</div></button><button data-v-63d94bc4="" class="jd26-ide-io-tab"><div data-v-63d94bc4="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-x-1 whitespace-nowrap"> Generated files <!----></div></button><button data-v-63d94bc4="" class="jd26-ide-io-tab"><div data-v-63d94bc4="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap"><!----> Debugger </div></button><button data-v-63d94bc4="" class="jd26-ide-io-tab"><span data-v-5bc8e04d="" data-v-63d94bc4="" class="flex items-center gap-1"> GUI <!----></span></button></div><div data-v-63d94bc4="" class="h-full"><div class="jd26-ide-outputwrap surface-secondary-header flex h-auto  w-full flex-col overflow-auto print:break-inside-avoid print:border print:p-1"><div><div class="w-full" id="ideOutputEditor"><div id="output" data-testid="OutputEditor" class="stroke-secondary-default w-full border border-opacity-80 ace_editor ace-jdoodle-light" style="height: 80px; min-height: 114px;"><textarea class="ace_text-input" wrap="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" style="opacity: 0; font-size: 1px; top: 40px; left: 20px; height: 1px; width: 1px;" aria-label="Program output and input"></textarea><div class="ace_gutter" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none; left: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="ace_layer ace_gutter-layer ace_folding-enabled" style="height: 1e+06px; top: 20px; left: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="ace_gutter-cell ace_gutter-active-line " style="height: 20px; top: 0px;">1<span style="display: none;"></span></div></div></div><div class="ace_scroller" style="line-height: 20px; left: 0px; right: 0px; bottom: 0px;"><div class="ace_content" style="top: 20px; left: 0px; width: 295px; height: 153px;"><div class="ace_layer ace_print-margin-layer"><div class="ace_print-margin" style="left: 548px; visibility: hidden;"></div></div><div class="ace_layer ace_marker-layer"></div><div class="ace_layer ace_text-layer" style="height: 1e+06px; margin: 0px 20px; top: 0px; left: 0px;"><div class="ace_line" style="height: 20px; top: 0px;"></div></div><div class="ace_layer ace_marker-layer"></div><div class="ace_layer ace_cursor-layer ace_hidden-cursors"><div class="ace_cursor" style="display: block; top: 0px; left: 20px; width: 7px; height: 20px;"></div></div></div></div><div class="ace_scrollbar ace_scrollbar-v" style="display: none; width: 17px; bottom: 0px;"><div class="ace_scrollbar-inner" style="width: 17px; height: 60px;">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="ace_scrollbar ace_scrollbar-h" style="display: none; height: 17px; left: 0px; right: 0px;"><div class="ace_scrollbar-inner" style="height: 17px; width: 295px;">&nbsp;</div></div><div style="height: auto; width: auto; top: 0px; left: 0px; visibility: hidden; position: absolute; white-space: pre; font: inherit; overflow: hidden;"><div style="height: auto; width: auto; top: 0px; left: 0px; visibility: hidden; position: absolute; white-space: pre; font: inherit; overflow: visible;">הההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההההה</div><div style="height: auto; width: auto; top: 0px; left: 0px; visibility: hidden; position: absolute; white-space: pre; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; overflow: visible;">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</div></div></div></div></div><div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><div data-v-63d94bc4="" class="h-full" style="display: none;"><div data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-pane"><!----><div data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-screen" style="display: none;"></div><div data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-message"><p data-v-b75bec6d="">Verilog programs run as console programs here.</p><p data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-message-sub"> They print to <span data-v-b75bec6d="" class="font-semibold">Output</span> rather than opening a window, so there is nothing for this tab to show. </p><p data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-message-sub"> A live GUI window is currently available for <span data-v-b75bec6d="" class="font-semibold">C, C++, C++ 14, C++ 17, C++ 20, C++ 23, C99, Clojure, FreeBASIC, Groovy, Java, Kotlin, Perl, PyPy3, Python, R Language, Rhino JS, Ruby, Scala, Tcl</span>. We're adding more languages over time. </p><p data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-message-sub"> Want a GUI window for Verilog? <a data-v-b75bec6d="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/contact-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="jd26-gui-link">Contact support</a> to request it. </p></div><p data-v-b75bec6d="" class="jd26-gui-upsell"> Free plans get 1 window at a time, up to 5 minutes. <a data-v-b75bec6d="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="jd26-gui-upsell-cta">Upgrade</a> for a bigger workspace - 5 at once, up to 15 minutes each. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div class="h-full w-full overflow-auto" id="tabs-about" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tabs-about-item" style="display: none;"><section data-v-646a1552="" id="jdoodle-about" class="overflow-auto bg-jd26-ide-canvas h-full px-4 py-4"><div data-v-646a1552="" class=""><h2 data-v-646a1552="" class="text-[1.25rem] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-jd26-ide-strong">Free online Verilog compiler and editor</h2><div data-v-646a1552="" class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-jd26-ide-text"><p data-v-646a1552=""> JDoodle is an online IDE that has served the programming community since 2013. You write, compile, and run code in the browser for Verilog and many other languages, without installing a toolchain. </p><p data-v-646a1552=""> What you see on this page is JDoodle’s free Verilog compiler. Write Verilog in the editor, press Execute, and JDoodle runs it on its servers. You do not install Verilog, and you do not need a JDoodle account to run code. </p><h2 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-4 text-[1.15rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-jd26-ide-strong">Online Verilog editor</h2><p data-v-646a1552=""> JDoodle’s Verilog editor on this page highlights syntax, completes as you type, matches brackets, and folds blocks.  It is an online Verilog editor and a compiler together: you write here, then Execute runs your program on JDoodle’s servers. </p><div data-v-646a1552="" class="jd26-about-fold"><div data-v-646a1552="" class="jd26-about-foldhead"><h2 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-4 text-[1.15rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-jd26-ide-strong">Verilog versions on JDoodle</h2></div><p data-v-646a1552=""> JDoodle currently ships these Verilog builds. Choose one from the version menu before you execute. The installed releases are 10.1, 10.2, 10.3, 11, 12, and 13.0. </p><table data-v-646a1552="" class="w-full text-left text-[13px]"><thead data-v-646a1552=""><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline text-jd26-ide-muted"><!----><th data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-medium">Version</th></tr></thead><tbody data-v-646a1552=""><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline"><!----><td data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-mono text-[12px] text-jd26-ide-text">10.1</td></tr><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline"><!----><td data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-mono text-[12px] text-jd26-ide-text">10.2</td></tr><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline"><!----><td data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-mono text-[12px] text-jd26-ide-text">10.3</td></tr><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline"><!----><td data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-mono text-[12px] text-jd26-ide-text">11</td></tr><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline"><!----><td data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-mono text-[12px] text-jd26-ide-text">12</td></tr><tr data-v-646a1552="" class="border-b border-jd26-ide-hairline"><!----><td data-v-646a1552="" class="py-2 font-mono text-[12px] text-jd26-ide-text">13.0</td></tr></tbody></table><!----></div><!----><!----><div data-v-646a1552="" class="jd26-about-fold"><div data-v-646a1552="" class="jd26-about-foldhead"><h2 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-4 text-[1.15rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-jd26-ide-strong"> Frequently asked questions </h2></div><h3 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold text-jd26-ide-strong">Is JDoodle’s online Verilog compiler free?</h3><p data-v-646a1552="">Yes. JDoodle lets you write and run Verilog without paying. A JDoodle account is only needed to save projects, use more AI credits, or unlock faster workspaces.</p><h3 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold text-jd26-ide-strong">Do I need to install Verilog to use JDoodle?</h3><p data-v-646a1552="">No. JDoodle runs Verilog on its servers. Open this page in a browser and execute.</p><h3 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold text-jd26-ide-strong">Which Verilog version should I pick on JDoodle?</h3><p data-v-646a1552="">Choose the version that matches the course or codebase you are working against from the version menu. The builds JDoodle has installed are 10.1, 10.2, 10.3, 11, 12, and 13.0.</p><h3 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold text-jd26-ide-strong">Can I run a multi-file Verilog project online?</h3><p data-v-646a1552="">Not on this page, which runs a single Verilog file. For several files in one project, open the <a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/execute-verilog-online-ide" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">JDoodle Verilog IDE</a>. Everything else works the same on both.</p><h3 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold text-jd26-ide-strong">Is this an online Verilog editor or a compiler?</h3><p data-v-646a1552="">Both. The page is an online Verilog editor and it compiles and runs what you write.</p></div><p data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-2"> Input, interactive runs, files, and the rest of the editor work the same on every language. See the <a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/docs/ide" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">JDoodle IDE documentation</a>. </p><div data-v-646a1552="" class="jd26-about-fold"><div data-v-646a1552="" class="jd26-about-foldhead"><h2 data-v-646a1552="" class="pt-4 text-[1.15rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-jd26-ide-strong">More online compilers like Verilog</h2></div><p data-v-646a1552=""><a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/execute-sql-online" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">SQL</a><span data-v-646a1552="">, </span><a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/compile-nemerle-online" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">Nemerle</a><span data-v-646a1552="">, </span><a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/compile-oz-mozart-online" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">OZ Mozart</a><span data-v-646a1552="">, </span><a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/execute-whitespace-online" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">Whitespace</a><span data-v-646a1552="">, </span><a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/psql" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">PostgreSQL</a><span data-v-646a1552="">, </span><a data-v-646a1552="" href="https://www.jdoodle.com/mysql" class="decoration-jd26-ide-accent/30 text-jd26-ide-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-jd26-ide-accent">MySQL</a><!----></p></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="jd26-ide-promoslot jd26-ide-promoslot-full jd26-ide-promoslot-reserved" style="--jd26-ide-promo-w: 300px; --jd26-ide-promo-h: 90px;"><div class="jd26-ide-promoslot-box jd26-ide-nudge is-compact"><img src="./Parity_generator._files/JD_logo_small-83b0f20b.svg" alt="" class="jd26-ide-nudge-art" width="40" height="40"><div class="jd26-ide-nudge-say"><!----><p class="jd26-ide-nudge-title">JDoodle is built for you</p><p class="jd26-ide-nudge-lede">Something broken or missing? We can improve it together.</p></div><a href="https://www.jdoodle.com/contact-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="jd26-ide-nudge-cta">Tell us</a></div></div></div><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="overflow-auto sm:overflow-hidden print:break-inside-avoid print:border print:p-1 hidden" id="tabs-input-mobile-main"><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="jd26-ide-io-head jd26-ide-io-head-tabs print:hidden"><button data-v-c9f9a3ec="" type="button" class="jd26-ide-io-tab jd26-ide-io-tab-active"> Options </button><button data-v-c9f9a3ec="" type="button" class="jd26-ide-io-tab" title="External libraries"> Libraries </button><button data-v-c9f9a3ec="" type="button" class="jd26-ide-io-tab" title="Upload input files"> Files </button></div><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="jd26-ide-io-head jd26-ide-io-head-input print:hidden"><div data-v-c9f9a3ec="" class="jd26-ide-verpick"><button type="button" class="jd26-ide-verpick-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-label="Language version, 13.0"><span class="truncate">13.0</span><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></